1
00:00:00,199 --> 00:00:03,659
That woman has the attention span
of a gnat.

2
00:00:04,286 --> 00:00:07,576
Hey, Leonard. Sheldon says
you're going to the North Pole.

3
00:00:07,748 --> 00:00:09,038
(Leonard:)Yeah. Pretty cool, huh?

4
00:00:09,208 --> 00:00:12,088
(Penny:)Yeah, I'm just a little surprised
you didn't tell me.

5
00:00:12,253 --> 00:00:13,923
(Leonard:)Well, it all happened kind of fast.

6
00:00:14,088 --> 00:00:17,008
(Leonard:)And we had to get physicals
and buy thermal underwear...

7
00:00:17,174 --> 00:00:19,964
(Leonard:)...and study up on, you know,
snow and stuff.

8
00:00:21,554 --> 00:00:24,644
(Leonard:)- Sorry, I was gonna tell you.
- No, you don't have to apologize.

9
00:00:24,807 --> 00:00:28,057
(Penny:)There's no reason you have to tell me.
I was just surprised.

10
00:00:28,227 --> 00:00:30,977
(Sheldon:)You were busy, you were surprised,
all very fascinating.

11
00:00:31,146 --> 00:00:32,936
(Sheldon:)Now, where do we stand
on the freezer?

12
00:00:34,024 --> 00:00:35,274
(Penny:)Is he serious?

13
00:00:35,651 --> 00:00:37,151
(Leonard:)Actually, it would help.

14
00:00:37,861 --> 00:00:40,031
(Penny:)All right, I'll see what I can do.

15
00:00:40,197 --> 00:00:43,287
So, wow, three months
at the North Pole.

16
00:00:43,450 --> 00:00:46,910
(Penny:)- Wow, that is awesome.
- Yeah.

17
00:00:47,079 --> 00:00:52,079
(Sheldon:)Sorry but at what point do you put this
"see what you can do" plan into action?

18
00:00:53,335 --> 00:01:02,025
(Penny:)Just a warning, Sheldon.
The freezer locks from the outside.

